WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:25.400


00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.020
On this day,

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:46.550
the stupidest rivalry in history began.

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:20.750
Shido.

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:27.390
Shido!

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:32.550
Hey, Shido.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:36.410
Looks like I won this quarter.

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:40.120
Yotsuya...

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:44.369
You just got lucky. Don't get cocky.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.810
Of course I'm cocky.

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:49.100
I'm the top salesperson in the
department this quarter, after all.

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:50.160
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:52.599
If you're done, get back to Division 1.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:53.620
Huh?

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:57.240
By the way, how were your numbers?

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:03.440
You talked such a big game.

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:05.540
Aren't you embarrassed?

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:07.890
But... he was still #1 in Division 2.

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:09.020
Shut up.

00:02:09.021 --> 00:02:10.260
What's your problem?

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:11.659
Did you come here just to gloat?

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:12.860
I'm not gloating.

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:14.980
I'm just stating the
"results" of our match.

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:16.050
Listen up.

00:02:16.051 --> 00:02:18.839
My projects are only
going to get bigger from here.

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.530
Onishi-san!

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.950
Going at it again this quarter, I see.

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:26.340
- You'd better get used to it.
- Used to it?

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:29.000
Their rivalry is a Sales Department staple.

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:31.590
Competing over numbers
is business as usual.

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:39.920
I did tell you both to
submit more proposals...

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:44.109
I had three more ideas than this guy.

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:46.179
Proposals are about quality, not quantity.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.579
Submitting a bunch of useless ideas
is just a waste of time.

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:51.979
Instead of talking trash,
go work on your files.

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:54.980
They take every chance they get
to try and outdo each other.

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:57.140
In work...

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:03.340
It's pretty impressive.

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:05.440
And in everything else, too...

00:03:07.254 --> 00:03:09.670
Was it like this at the welcome party?

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:12.910
Yeah. They're both incredibly competitive.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:15.650
Wait, they're gone.

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:24.210
Oh, Minami-san.

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:24.940
Sorry.

00:03:24.941 --> 00:03:26.069
Could you be our judge for a second?

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:26.760
Huh?

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:27.850
Please.

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:29.250
Wait, what?

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:30.250
What's going on?

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:32.280
That happens a lot.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:33.560
Just get used to it.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.250
Ready... go!

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:44.700
Ugh... damn it.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:50.750
Yes!

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:52.220
Damn it...

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:53.580
Now then,

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:57.350
what should I make the loser, Shido, do?

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.990
The way you talk is as annoying as ever.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:02.489
If there's something to compare,

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:04.950
they won't stop until there's a winner.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:09.820
Understood.

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:12.180
I'll do my best to meet your expectations.

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:15.780
I'll keep you updated on our progress.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:17.400
Yes.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:19.260
If there's anything else you need,

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:20.810
please feel free to contact me.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:22.280
Yes.

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:25.910
I'll be in touch.

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:29.240
Excuse me.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:33.950
Higashino.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.040
Yes!

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:37.090
Um...

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:38.760
Sorry if I startled you earlier.

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:40.080
Oh, no.

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:41.570
But, well...

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:43.140
I was just a bit surprised.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:45.610
Shido-san usually seems

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:47.160
so cool and collected.

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:52.330
Right? But why does his IQ just
plummet whenever Yotsuya-san is around?

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:54.580
Just looking at his face

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:56.660
makes my blood boil.

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:59.040
By the way, Yotsuya-san is in Division 1.

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:00.180
If you want to compare sales,

00:05:00.181 --> 00:05:02.220
why not just compete with us in Division 2?

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:05.020
It's not about competing with just anyone.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:06.570
I just...

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:09.340
simply don't want to lose to Yotsuya.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.010
I've been wondering for a while now.

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:14.800
Why are you so obsessed with Yotsuya-san?

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.000
Is there a reason besides

00:05:16.001 --> 00:05:17.150
being in the same year...?

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:20.370
We're bound to each other.

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.390
We've been rivals since high school.

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.080
Oh, is that so?

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:27.310
I know it's stupid for a grown man,

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:29.030
but

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:31.280
it's become a habit.

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:31.990
Just curious,

00:05:31.991 --> 00:05:33.940
is there a penalty game for the loser?

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.000
Oh.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:12.630
You're here.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:15.970
I can't believe you made
me carry all this heavy stuff.

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.020
Winner's rules, right?

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:21.010
Of course...

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:24.480
Alright, come on in.

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:28.240
Excuse me.

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:32.730
Now then,

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:35.760
to celebrate my #1 sales rank...

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:38.630
Cheers!

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:42.260
Why do I have to celebrate you?

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.890
Didn't you make the rules?

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.360
The loser does what the winner says.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:50.760
Just accept it and celebrate me.

00:06:51.980 --> 00:06:52.980
Now,

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:54.110
let's have the next round.

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:57.480
Whoever finishes their bottle first wins.

00:06:58.390 --> 00:06:59.390
Are you a child?

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:02.720
Not confident?

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:12.900
Challenge accepted.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:15.900
"Fake Fact Lips"

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:21.100
(Episode 1: The first one to fall loses!)

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:24.640
Alright, I win again.

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:29.140
Don't underestimate my iron liver,

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:31.420
hardened by business dinners.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:32.780
That's only because...

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:35.660
I drank too much with a client yesterday.

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:37.300
So,

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:39.210
this match wasn't fair.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:40.760
Stop sulking.

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:43.580
You're the one who started this.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:46.015
What? I'm not sulking.

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:47.060
Fine, fine.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.520
Just drink some water.

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:52.250
You're naive, Ryo.

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:53.620
Huh?

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:56.129
If you think I'll keep losing,

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:57.810
you're dead wrong.

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:07.950
Kiritani...

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:10.556
The beauty from the Secretary's Office!

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:11.580
This morning,

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:12.840
she secretly

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:14.430
handed this to me personally.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:17.370
But it's too early to be surprised.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:18.780
Look at the back.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.180
This is...!

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:24.680
It's a struggle,

00:09:25.380 --> 00:09:29.210
being personally invited by
the office's "unreachable flower."

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:33.340
Looks like I win this round.

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:41.280
Ryo?

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:44.980
- What's wrong?
- You have terrible taste.

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:46.040
Huh?

00:09:46.041 --> 00:09:48.810
I feel bad for Ms. Kiritani.

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:51.989
I didn't know she was the shallow type
who only picks men for their looks.

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:54.030
You're saying I'm just a pretty face?

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.840
Isn't that why every woman approaches you?

00:09:57.840 --> 00:10:03.579
Yoshizawa in 10th grade, Saki and
Mitsui-senpai in 11th, Airi-chan in 12th...

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:04.580
Shut up!

00:10:04.730 --> 00:10:06.310
You sure remember them well.

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:09.490
That's because you bragged
every time you got a girlfriend

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:12.790
and complained every time you broke up.

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:14.430
No.

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:15.630
That's not it.

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:16.660
Huh?

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:18.070
You're jealous, aren't you?

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:19.890
Jealous of how popular I am.

00:10:21.340 --> 00:10:22.340
I am not...

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:24.239
No matter how good you are at work,

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:26.250
your luck with women is pathetic.

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:31.190
And you're so
obsessed with women

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:32.999
that you can't beat me at work.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:35.290
I told you, that was just this quarter!

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:36.480
No, not necessarily.

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:38.689
You're getting cocky
over one business card.

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:40.029
You're hopeless for next quarter.

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:43.290
Anyway, I win the "popularity" round.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:47.830
A high-maintenance guy
with a big ego like you...

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.049
your true colors will show
as soon as you start dating.

00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:55.959
Huh? You mean "a man
with pride and principles."

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.280
And I hate losing.

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:01.830
A man hungry for victory has a future.

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:03.750
And most importantly, me?

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:06.410
I'm hot.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.000
Hmm?

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:11.070
What's wrong?

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:13.040
Lost for words?

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:15.760
No, I'm just speechless.

00:11:16.060 --> 00:11:17.640
Go ahead, admire

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:21.049
this face that everyone loves.

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:22.550
Stop being so full of yourself.

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:24.330
Me?

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:27.920
Back in college, a guy with a girlfriend
even confessed to me.

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:29.510
That's gross.

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:31.260
Wait, really?

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:32.920
It was a pain.

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:34.460
But honestly,

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:37.830
I'm just as good-looking
as any of your exes, right?

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:40.370
Some people have weird taste.

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:43.540
You sound like a sore loser.

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:47.330
Me?

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:50.320
I'd rather sleep with a
woman I don't even like

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:53.170
than touch someone like you.

00:11:53.300 --> 00:11:55.130
What the hell? What are you talking about?

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:57.399
Why are you assuming
I'm the one being touched?

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.889
Because you said you're as good as my exes.

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:01.170
No, that's not what I meant!

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:03.949
Besides, even if I were a woman,

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:06.990
I'd never want to be with
someone as unskilled as you.

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:09.819
What do you know about my skills?

00:12:09.844 --> 00:12:11.784
I don't need to see it to know.

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:13.520
You're probably the same.

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:15.680
You just rely on your looks

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:18.299
and act like a dead fish in bed.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:19.729
What? No!

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:21.929
Wait, did you just admit I'm handsome?

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:23.380
Don't change the subject.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.080
I hit a nerve, didn't I?

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:26.859
You're probably the type
who only cares about himself

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:29.000
and finishes instantly. A
total "one-minute man."

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:32.839
What? You'd definitely
finish first. Want to bet?

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:35.120
No, you would.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:36.440
Let's settle this.

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:40.130
Huh?

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:44.699
Let's see who can last the
longest without finishing.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:47.160
Stop talking crazy, you drunk.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.690
Trying to run away?

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.570
Fine, I get it.

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:54.790
I don't even need to compete to know.

00:12:55.316 --> 00:12:56.316
You're just a...

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:57.410
Zen...

00:12:58.440 --> 00:12:59.440
What?

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.640
You're the one who suggested this.

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:05.690
Don't regret it.

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:11.370
Fine by me.

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:19.300
Alright, we start in three minutes.

00:13:20.153 --> 00:13:22.393
Pick whatever video you like.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.440
You have to admit it when you finish.

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:27.450
No cheating.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:28.960
Where are you going?

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:29.500
Hmm?

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:30.500
Bathroom.

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:33.270
Why?

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:44.240
That's not fair.

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.290
Hey.

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:07.410
Did you stop?

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:09.250
No.

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:11.130
This is weird.

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:13.420
What is even happening?

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:14.840
What do you mean?

00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:15.840
It's a competition.

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:17.670
You started it.

00:14:19.490 --> 00:14:20.830
I know, but...

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:24.390
By the way...

00:14:25.850 --> 00:14:27.220
About what you said...

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:29.490
You know...

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:33.680
Did you do this kind of thing
with that guy in college?

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:34.810
Huh?

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:37.370
Oh...

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:40.670
I'm not really against stuff between guys.

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:43.580
Wait, really?

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:49.450
Hey!

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:50.700
What are you doing!

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:51.590
Don't touch me.

00:14:51.591 --> 00:14:53.130
You said you weren't against it.

00:14:53.646 --> 00:14:55.016
Well, yeah, but...

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:57.610
I noticed you stopped earlier.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.110
Because this is weird.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:02.560
It's not a fair fight.

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:05.000
Hey, Ryo!

00:15:05.140 --> 00:15:06.140
Wait.

00:15:23.390 --> 00:15:24.390
There.

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:26.750
I win.

00:15:35.980 --> 00:15:37.280
What is wrong with you today?

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:40.360
This is the worst.

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:43.780
I'm going home.

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.200
Hey.

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:49.020
I...

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:50.500
haven't finished yet.

00:15:50.890 --> 00:15:51.520
Huh?

00:15:51.521 --> 00:15:53.430
Deal with it yourself...

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:55.920
What are you doing?!

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.420
Since you have experience with men...

00:15:59.046 --> 00:16:00.046
let me hold you.

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:01.170
What?

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:02.460
Wait, how did it come to this?

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:04.590
The winner's word is law...

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:07.940
But...

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:14.569
We've known each
other so long, this is a first.

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:15.570
Huh...?

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.750
I can't believe you'd break the rules.

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:23.680
A man's word is his bond.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:43.440
Are you okay?

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:45.750
Shut up.

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:48.400
Who do you think caused this?

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:51.430
True.

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:57.550
If your body ends up
unable to live without me...

00:18:58.026 --> 00:18:59.026
I'm sorry.

00:18:59.483 --> 00:19:00.483
Look who's talking!

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:01.820
If you fall for me

00:19:01.821 --> 00:19:03.259
and can't date women anymore,

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:04.260
don't blame me.

00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:05.900
What?

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:09.370
You're the one who's going to fall for me.

00:19:11.470 --> 00:19:14.040
As if I'd ever fall for someone like you.

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:16.650
I'm not interested in you either...

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:21.370
Then...

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:23.670
want to test it?

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:24.670
Huh?

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:27.030
Let's have a match.

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:31.540
Fine by me.

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:34.300
Then...

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:37.020
The first one to fall for the other loses.

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:42.940
I accept.

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:54.070
The first one to get it down wins.

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:56.770
I accept.

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:02.200
Alright, let's go.

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:05.270
Let's settle this.

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:06.970
No way.

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:11.220
Damn it.

00:20:11.826 --> 00:20:14.896
Alright, what should I make you do next?

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:18.500
It's over.

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:19.580
Keep your promise.

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:21.050
Look at this.

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:22.250
Pretty crazy, right?

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.020
It's amazing, isn't it?

00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:27.500
- Wait, what?
- Ugh, so heavy.

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:28.660
Are you okay?

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:31.900
What's in here?

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:33.350
Yeah.

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.810
Enough, this is ridiculous.

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:55.580
With this, our rivalry

00:20:56.610 --> 00:20:58.010
is finally over.

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:00.960
I feel so much better.

00:21:05.405 --> 00:21:09.070
You're going to be so bored with
college life without me to compete with.

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:10.960
Don't flatter yourself.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:13.910
See ya.

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:49.160
Zen...?

00:21:52.130 --> 00:21:53.370
Hey, Ryo...

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:54.920
I knew it was you.

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:56.350
What are you doing here?

00:21:56.670 --> 00:21:57.670
What do you think?

00:21:57.750 --> 00:21:58.750
The entrance ceremony.

00:22:01.400 --> 00:22:02.400
No way...

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:05.460
You've got to be kidding me...

00:22:06.760 --> 00:22:07.760
Ah.

00:22:08.190 --> 00:22:09.190
Well, in that case...

00:22:09.570 --> 00:22:10.570
Then...

00:22:10.880 --> 00:22:11.980
want to go another round?

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:14.430
What?

00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:16.040
Do you even have to ask?

00:22:16.570 --> 00:22:17.570
A competition, obviously.

00:22:22.790 --> 00:22:24.640
First one to make it big wins.

00:22:27.800 --> 00:22:29.000
I accept.

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:05.100
Want me to make something?

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:07.610
Want some coffee?

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:09.490
Huh?

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:12.280
Hmm...

00:23:16.590 --> 00:23:17.590
Oh.

00:23:18.760 --> 00:23:19.960
Almost forgot.

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:33.790
Good morning.

00:23:38.590 --> 00:23:40.130
What's with that face?

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:43.540
The match already started, didn't it?

00:23:44.243 --> 00:23:45.243
Huh?

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:47.500
The first one to fall in love loses.

00:23:50.440 --> 00:23:52.530
You're not thinking of
backing out now, are you?

00:23:55.390 --> 00:23:56.590
No way.

00:23:57.250 --> 00:23:58.250
Also...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:23:59.690
I don't want coffee anymore.

00:24:14.730 --> 00:24:15.730
See ya.

00:24:27.630 --> 00:24:29.060
Sorry.

00:25:32.710 --> 00:25:35.306
(Next Episode) If you wanted to
make someone you don't like fall for you...

00:25:35.330 --> 00:25:36.506
(Episode 2: Then I won't hold back)
what would you do?

00:25:36.530 --> 00:25:38.000
Hey, Yotsuya.

00:25:38.570 --> 00:25:40.210
I had fun yesterday.

00:25:41.090 --> 00:25:42.530
Want me to play with you again?

00:25:44.190 --> 00:25:45.190
What do you think?

00:25:45.830 --> 00:25:47.580
Where is this coming from?

00:25:47.710 --> 00:25:49.740
We did spend the night together, after all.

00:25:50.410 --> 00:25:51.650
Don't underestimate me.

00:25:52.070 --> 00:25:53.070
How do you usually...

00:25:53.190 --> 00:25:54.720
seduce men?

00:25:55.480 --> 00:25:57.320
I told you, that was
my first time with a guy.

00:25:57.560 --> 00:25:58.560
I don't have experience.

00:25:59.360 --> 00:26:00.560
What about you? Have you?

00:26:01.120 --> 00:26:02.220
Since high school.